# DiskPond desktop development needs no .env file or hosted-service credentials.
# Use pnpm dev:desktop from the repository root.
#
# Runtime options are set in the calling shell, not in this file:
# GO_BINARY          Optional absolute path to the Go executable.
# DISKPOND_DATA_DIR  Optional absolute, unpackaged-only app-data override.
# DISKPOND_TEST_TMP  Existing parent directory for temporary smoke fixtures.
#
# Legacy API/WEB/CLOUD configuration is awaiting M2 extraction. Default URLs
# are loopback; desktop analytics keys are forced empty by the build configs.
# The former hosted-stack template is retained at the pinned upstream commit
# linked from UPSTREAM.md.
